        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    closing_prices = [150, 155, 153, 157, 160]\n    volumes = [1000, 1500, 1200, 1800, 2000]\n\n    obv = 0\n    for i in range(1, len(closing_prices)):\n        if closing_prices[i] > closing_prices[i - 1]:\n            obv += volumes[i]\n        elif closing_prices[i] < closing_prices[i - 1]:\n            obv -= volumes[i]\n\n    return obv\n```",
